      "statement": "pnpm dev runs scripts/dev.mjs, which bootstraps .env from .env.example, generates pairing and MCP auth tokens when missing or placeholder, spawns the WebSocket and MCP servers with tsx watch, waits for GET /health on both before printing readiness, supervises children with 2s-backoff restart up to 5 attempts, and shuts them down gracefully on SIGINT/SIGTERM.",
